      "description": "Get ready for Bible Bowl — one quiz at a time.\n\nL2L Bible Bowl is the official study companion for students preparing for the annual Bible Bowl competition at the Lads-to-Leaders convention. Whether you're brushing up on a single book or chapter or grinding through a full practice run, this app makes studying feel less like a chore and more like a challenge you actually want to beat.\n\nWhat you'll find inside:\n- A colorful, easy-to-navigate interface built for students\n- Multiple profiles, so every child in the household can study and track their own progress\n- Quizzes organized by book of the Bible\n- Access to past years' question packs for extra practice\n- This year's official question set included free with download\n- Personal stats and score tracking for each profile, so kids can see how far they've come\n\nPerfect for families with more than one Bible Bowl competitor — each child gets their own space to study, compete with themselves, and grow. Study on your own time, track your progress, and walk into convention ready. \n\nL2L Bible Bowl helps you hide God's Word in your heart — and know it well enough to compete with confidence.\n\nGrowing every year: The current year's question set (1 Kings) is free with download. Additional question packs from previous competition years are also included as free in-app purchases, so your family can keep building a full library of practice material as your students advance through Bible Bowl. Future years will be available as paid in-app purchases when available for download.",
